<title>USA: Texas/w Okla fed cattle trade inactive - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla fed cattle trade inactive - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade inactive in the panhandle area early  Friday, USDA said.</p>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers not tested. Feedlots reporting light  inquiry from buyers; following weekly movement of 112,000. The last  established price was 66.00 on Tuesday. Today's packer bids are 65.00-65.50  with asking prices 66.00-67.00. Note all cattle prices based on net  weights FOB the feedlot after a 4 percent shrink.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
